{
  "name": "Onmyoji - Realm Raid",
  "description": "Auto-raid Realm Raid targets: picks a target from the 3x3 grid, attacks, clears the result screen, and refreshes the list (confirming the reset dialog) when nothing is raidable. Resilient poll: STOPS on a verification/CAPTCHA screen (anti-ban), on a full inventory, and when the daily attempts are used up. Dismisses confirm popups and reward screens on its own. Start it ON the activity screen.",
